11.3512 15.5297L9.73505 15.8529C9.38519 15.9229 9.07673 15.6144 9.14671 15.2646L9.46993 13.6484C9.48929 13.5517 9.53687 13.4628 9.60667 13.393L12.9996 10C13.5519 9.44771 14.4473 9.44771 14.9996 10C15.5519 10.5523 15.5519 11.4477 14.9996 12L11.6067 15.393C11.5369 15.4628 11.448 15.5103 11.3512 15.5297Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>Memory updated</button></div><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="3c91cfff-d19d-4a02-8f07-c1f41d96772e" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-4o"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark"><p>Here are some suggestions to make your movie site appealing to youngsters using HTML and CSS:</p><h3><strong>1. Modern &amp; Vibrant UI</strong></h3><ul><li>Use <strong>dark mode</strong> with neon or bright accent colors (e.g., purple, cyan, red).</li><li>Choose a <strong>trendy font</strong> like Poppins or Montserrat from Google Fonts.</li><li>Add <strong>hover effects</strong> on movie posters with CSS transitions.</li></ul><h3><strong>2. Responsive &amp; Mobile-Friendly Design</strong></h3><ul><li>Use <strong>flexbox or grid</strong> to ensure a responsive layout.</li><li>Implement a <strong>hamburger menu</strong> for mobile navigation.</li><li>Use <strong>media queries</strong> to adjust elements for different screen sizes.</li></ul><h3><strong>3. Interactive Features</strong></h3><ul><li>Movie cards with a <strong>hover effect</strong> showing a brief description.</li><li><strong>Search bar</strong> with autocomplete for quick movie searches.</li><li>Buttons with smooth <strong>color transitions</strong> and <strong>box shadows</strong>.</li></ul><h3><strong>4. Homepage Sections</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Hero Banner:</strong> A large movie poster or slideshow with CSS animations.</li><li><strong>Trending Movies:</strong> A scrolling carousel using CSS or JavaScript.</li><li><strong>Genres:</strong> Grid layout for different genres with hover animations.</li></ul><h3><strong>5. CSS Enhancements</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Glassmorphism effect</strong> on search bars or movie details.</li><li>Use <strong>CSS animations</strong> for button clicks and section reveals.</li><li><strong>Parallax effect</strong> for a dynamic background.</li></ul><h3><strong>6. Custom Scrollbar &amp; Theme Toggle</strong></h3><ul><li>Use <strong>::-webkit-scrollbar</strong> to customize scrollbars.</li><li>Implement a <strong>light/dark mode switch</strong> using CSS variables.</li></ul><p>Would you like any specific CSS code snippets for these?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-2 flex gap-3 empty:hidden -ml-2"><div class="items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 z-10 -mt-1 bg-token-main-surface-primary screen-arch:mt-1 md:absolute md:sr-only"><div class="flex items-center"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="rounded-lg text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary" aria-label="Read aloud" data-testid="voice-play-turn-action-button"><span class="flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11 4.9099C11 4.47485 10.4828 4.24734 10.1621 4.54132L6.67572 7.7372C6.49129 7.90626 6.25019 8.00005 6 8.00005H4C3.44772 8.00005 3 8.44776 3 9.00005V15C3 15.5523 3.44772 16 4 16H6C6.25019 16 6.49129 16.0938 6.67572 16.2629L10.1621 19.4588C10.4828 19.7527 11 19.5252 11 19.0902V4.9099ZM8.81069 3.06701C10.4142 1.59714 13 2.73463 13 4.9099V19.0902C13 21.2655 10.4142 22.403 8.81069 20.9331L5.61102 18H4C2.34315 18 1 16.6569 1 15V9.00005C1 7.34319 2.34315 6.00005 4 6.00005H5.61102L8.81069 3.06701ZM20.3166 6.35665C20.8019 6.09313 21.409 6